================================================================================
GENERATED CODE
================================================================================

What sce-codegen derives from YOUR input document is yours. What it copies
from SCE's templates is covered by the Linking Exception, section 3: use it
in your application under terms of your choice, as long as the generator
was unmodified and the application is not a competing product.

See: LICENSE-GENERATED.md

